        26
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Butte_Falls%2C_Oregon"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Pacific and Eastern Railroad reached Butte Falls in 1910, linking the town's destiny to the railroad for the next half century.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
